  "guide": {
    "by": "Written by your Hermes model",
    "guide": [
      {
        "text": "These sources are an about-us page and a fall office catering menu for Salvia Kitchen.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_3101a8423524"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P3",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_6f26291c8ee3"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ana and her brother Tomas run it. They opened their commercial kitchen in 2022.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_3101a8423524"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Last year they catered 214 events and served about 9,600 guests, mostly office lunches and baby showers.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_3101a8423524"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Boxed lunches cost $16 per person with a 10-box minimum. Family-style trays cost $24 per person for at least 15 guests.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_6f26291c8ee3"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_6f26291c8ee3"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Orders need 72 hours notice. Delivery is free within 10 miles of downtown and costs $35 beyond that.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_6f26291c8ee3"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "asks": [],
    "questions": [
      {
        "text": "Trays cost $24 per person and boxed lunches cost $16, a gap of $8 per person. What does an office group of 15 get for that extra $8?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_6f26291c8ee3"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_6f26291c8ee3"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Last year brought 214 events and about 9,600 guests, but trays only come in sizes for 15, 25 or 40 guests. How are bigger events served?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_3101a8423524"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_6f26291c8ee3"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Office lunches are most of the business, but every order needs 72 hours notice. How often does that rule turn away last-minute office orders?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_3101a8423524"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_6f26291c8ee3"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      }
    ],
